## Set up

Paste the setup prompt into your coding agent, or run three commands and give Claude Code one sentence. On the example app, a first clip took [six to twelve minutes](/start/authoring/).

<HowItWorks />

<Setup />

## After CI: version.cam

The recorder and the GitHub Action are free and run in your CI. version.cam keeps the recordings after CI has made them.

<Hosted />

